his next question is about Joe  welding and it's already been answered  but his third question is about  crossbows and it's in three parts he  says I crossbows finally functional  weapons as in can they be aimed like a  bow fired while moving and not have to  be reloaded immediately after firing so  the first bit can they be aimed like a  boat they can be aimed in first-person  so I assume that's what you mean  five volleying I think actually the  difference between crossbows and bows  this time around is that bows can't be  fired while moving but we'll have to see  but I'm pretty sure that's the case and  the third bit not have to be reloaded  immediately after firing they do have to  be reloaded I'm quite sure to be ready  for the next round all right guys last  question is by Ogami 23 who says how do  you feel about the making Dark Souls 2  instead of a new Souls game and you know  I was a little disappointed when they  announced Dark Souls 2 because I really  liked the sound of Dragon souls or  something like that and I really liked  the naming scheme of the souls series  you know you can change it up you don't  have to put two at the end all you have  to do is change that first word which is  dark or demons or dragon so whatever you  want it to be I'm glad it's a sequel to  Dark Souls because I think Dark Souls is  universe has way more potential to  explore and there's so many unanswered  questions so I'm glad we get a bit of  finality so in the end I'm really glad  they made Dark Souls 2 alright that does  it for me for the day guys if you have a  question that wasn't answered and that's  pretty likely considering there were  5000 of them just leave it below I'll be  answering the questions in this comment  section pretty much exclusively over the  next few days so just leave it there if  you had a question other than that  thanks for watching and I'll see you in  the next one Cheers  you
 

